  "content": "\n\n<h2>AutoReconnect (Reforged)</h2>\n<p>這是 Bstn1802 的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Bstn1802/AutoReconnect\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoReconnect</a> 之多載入器更新版本。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>若您未在點擊斷開連接按鈕的情況下與世界或伺服器斷線，此模組將嘗試為您重新連線。預設情況下，它會在 3、10、30 和 60 秒後進行 4 次重連嘗試。</p>\n<p>您也可以設定在成功自動重新連線至特定世界或伺服器時，傳送訊息或執行指令。</p>\n<h3>相依模組</h3>\n<p>Fabric：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p>\n<h3>鳴謝</h3>\n<p>AutoReconnect (Reforged) 以 Bstn1802 的 AutoReconnect 為基礎，並包含依授權條款重用的程式碼。</p>\n<p>Bstn1802 的 AutoReconnect 可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fA9rziLV4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://github.com/Bstn1802/AutoReconnect\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 取得。</p>\n<h3>授權條款</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-3.0-only</a></p>\n<h3>聯絡方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/AutoReconnect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/AutoReconnect?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub 問題追蹤\"></a></p>",
